# Deliberately weak sshd_config for testing Sentry
Port 22
PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords yes
X11Forwarding yes
MaxAuthTries 6
LoginGraceTime 120
Ciphers aes256-cbc,3des-cbc,aes128-ctr
AllowTcpForwarding yes
PermitUserEnvironment yes

Match User deploy
    PasswordAuthentication yes
